  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "* New item template `bowire-cli-cmd` — scaffolds an `IBowireCliCommand` implementation that contributes a `bowire <verb>` subcommand. Drop into any plugin project that references `Kuestenlogik.Bowire.Cli`.\n* New item template `bowire-mock-emit` — scaffolds an `IBowireMockEmitter` implementation that replays `BowireRecording` steps over a wire protocol. Matches the in-tree Kafka / AMQP / TacticalAPI emitter shape (binary-first payload precedence, `ReplaySpeed` + `Loop` honoured).\n* `bowire-plugin` template's generated `Directory.Packages.props` floor bumped to Bowire 1.6.0 (was 1.5.0). Matches the current compatibility-matrix baseline.",
